  15:/Users/jonathanbrown/Documents/dev/aura/lib/Aurora-SDK/libs/libDaisy//src/per/dac.h ****  ** For now connecting the DAC through other internal peripherals is also not supported.
ARM GAS  /var/folders/5k/4f4bd4s53799x6g80pw__chw0000gn/T//cc7ZBFUL.s 			page 141


  16:/Users/jonathanbrown/Documents/dev/aura/lib/Aurora-SDK/libs/libDaisy//src/per/dac.h ****  **
  17:/Users/jonathanbrown/Documents/dev/aura/lib/Aurora-SDK/libs/libDaisy//src/per/dac.h ****  ** Since the DAC channels have dedicated pins we don't need to pass in a pin config like with
